+From 805f809f20374159d8faa4f0283efa9fa91e9f6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
+Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:07:31 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(od-sevev): ship the leader picker (LEADER_PICK) and
+ the per-leader views
+MIME-Version: 1.0
+Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
+Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
+
+- LEADER_PICK (ux/rtl-map.md §8): a 3 × 3 face grid with הפתעה in the centre, the
+  bloc-balanced shuffle, the caption strip, the again button and fresh chip after an
+  election, the long-press / I leader card, keyboard and reduced-motion paths. It
+  replaces the title on a fresh game, follows EVOLVE_TX and the flash after every
+  election, and comes back after a reload mid-pick (leaderPickPending). The economy is
+  frozen while the pick is pending; a pick is saved before the stage returns.
+- The round-start sequence: the leader plate, Dubi's line, the fresh-face toast and the
+  5 s undo chip that reopens the same picker.
+- LeaderUi: one boundary for the round's leader. The stage figure and its tap prop at
+  propMouth (only the current leader's strips are resident), the crit word and react,
+  the press skin for everyone but Bibi (thermometer, court card and chip, dossier rows),
+  the Bibi-only views hidden (pardon row, aide, DOHA sticker), the source and spin skins,
+  and the leader's own story beat and first-tap squawk.
+- Liberman's "לא יושב" pill and Golan's "לאחד" pair prompt in T3.
+- Strings: the _LEADER keys are drawn; SHARE_TEXT_INVITE, OG_DESCRIPTION and OG_IMAGE_ALT
+  take their _NEXT texts through ux/tools/gen_strings.py; the shell reads the OG keys.
+- Tests: test_leader_pick.gd (14), the scene tests pick Bibi first, the invite pin moves
+  to "תורכם להקים ממשלה". tools/web/picker_web.mjs drives the flow in Chromium.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
+Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JZ6f2h5tcXVKGAwuAga5z8
